# 11. The unresolved Track 1 bass question

One decision was deliberately left open.

Should Track 1 use:

### A. Davul-only low end

Advantages:

- stranger;
- more original;
- more minimal;
- more radical;
- makes the percussion itself the bass engine.

Or:

### B. Muted electric bass + davul

Advantages:

- more seductive;
- more immediately compatible with Vocal House;
- greater harmonic movement;
- stronger bridge to the reference audience.

This was never conclusively settled.

It should therefore **not be silently fixed later**. fileciteturn9file12

