- one small three-note seed;
- related generations at different scales/positions/registers/forms;
- later generations shaped by earlier generations;
- older generations remain;
- self-similar polyphony;
- familiar without repeating.

This was not supposed to replace the earlier blueprint.

It was a later **test implementation**.

