# 20. Important Suno workflow discovery: Lyrics Assistant

A major practical discovery was that Suno’s Lyrics Assistant/Lyricist often understood the **conceptual compositional law** much better than the Create Style function.

When asked to interpret the long concept, it understood ideas such as:

- tiny three-note idea;
- everything grows from that seed;
- motif returns in changed forms;
- older forms remain present;
- new forms are affected by what already happened;
- generations overlap;
- inheritance and variation;
- each layer changes the ground for the next.

