# 37. What currently looks like genuine series-level DNA

The most defensible higher-order identity developed across the work is:

### 1. A catalogue, not a one-song genre recipe

Different tracks can occupy different electronic centres.

### 2. Originality through translation and invention

Do not simply reproduce genre presets.

